 kit backlog - lists the open issues nothing is in flight for, oldest first

   --json   --jq            prints the same facts as one JSON array; each issue carries branch, a
                            name or null

   --today                  only the issues opened in the last 24 hours; combines with the flags
                            below

   --all                    every open issue no change closes (the default); it stands alone
   --mine --others --owner


